{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22221","headline":"草堂前新开一池养鱼种荷日有幽趣 · 白居易","name":"草堂前新开一池养鱼种荷日有幽趣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淙淙三峡水，浩浩万顷陂。\n未如新塘上，微风动涟漪。\n小萍加泛泛，初蒲正离离。\n红鲤二三寸，白莲八九枝。\n绕水欲成径，护堤方插篱。\n已被山中客，呼作白家池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22221.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22221","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}